WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:07.729
One of the most stunning revelations from
Bob Woodward's new book, Rage, is that Donald

00:00:07.729 --> 00:00:13.000
Trump's former secretary of defense, Jim Mattis,
went to the director of National Intelligence,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.939
Dan Coats, and said, Dan, the time may come
where we need collective action on Donald

00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:27.699
Trump, which by every reasonable interpretation
that is code for the cabinet may have to come

00:00:27.699 --> 00:00:31.949
together and use the 25th Amendment to remove
Donald Trump.

00:00:31.949 --> 00:00:37.850
Bob Woodward's book also alleging that Jim
Mattis saw Donald Trump as, quote, dangerous

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.920
and, quote, unfit.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:46.730
And in a separate conversation recounted by
Bob Woodward, Jim Mattis reportedly said to

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:53.739
the DNI, DNI Dan Coats, quote, The president
has no moral compass, to which Dan Coats replied,

00:00:53.739 --> 00:00:56.940
True to him, a lie is not a lie.

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.280
It's just what he thinks.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.320
He doesn't know the difference between the
truth and a lie.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:07.120
So let's kind of dig into this at the big
picture level.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:11.890
I'm guessing most of my audience understands
it's not normal.

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:17.270
It's not typical for multiple high ranking
individuals like the secretary of defense

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.590
and the director of national intelligence
to be talking together about, hey, we might

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:26.140
at some point need to act to remove the president
because he is unfit and he cannot lead.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.160
That is not typical.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.479
That did not happen.

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:32.680
During Barack Obama, it didn't happen during
George W. Bush, although certainly George

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:38.030
W. Bush did a lot of things that were absolutely
atrocious and disgusting.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.110
This is not normal.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:42.140
Now, what do they mean when they say collective
action?

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.189
By every stretch of of my imagination, it
can mean one thing and one thing only, which

00:01:48.189 --> 00:01:51.750
is the potential use of the 25th Amendment
to remove a president.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.219
Now, the 25th Amendment.

00:01:53.219 --> 00:01:54.219
It's available.

00:01:54.219 --> 00:01:55.920
This is a public document.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.920
As you as you know, it has four articles in
it.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:04.530
The first three refer to other circumstances
where a president would have to be replaced.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:09.410
For example, if the president is incapacitated
for for some reason or if a president were

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.560
to die.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:14.360
The fourth article of the 25th Amendment is
the relevant one here.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:18.810
And thinking about what Jim Mattis was talking
about in that fourth article of the 25th Amendment

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:24.459
says that the vice president and cabinet officials
can vote on the removal of a president if

00:02:24.459 --> 00:02:28.629
the majority votes for removal, meaning the
V.P.

00:02:28.629 --> 00:02:34.790
Plus the cabinet, a letter goes to the leader,
the Senate pro temp and the speaker of the

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:38.239
House telling them we have voted to remove
the president.

00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:43.010
The president is then able to respond if the
president disagrees with his removal or her

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.739
removal, in this case, his removal.

00:02:44.739 --> 00:02:49.360
The president can write a letter to the Senate
in the House saying, I am fit to serve.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.610
And then both houses of Congress would have
to vote now.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:58.970
In the meantime, if the vice president sends
a letter saying, I agree that the president

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:05.200
is unfit until the House and Senate vote,
the vice president becomes acting president

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.320
of the United States.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:09.260
It's sticky and it's sloppy and it's convoluted.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:14.770
But the point here is Jim Mattis, the then
secretary of defense, brought this to the

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.970
director of national intelligence and said,
we may need to do this.

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:20.459
We may need collective action.

00:03:20.459 --> 00:03:23.720
That alone is one of the biggest scandals
of the last many decades.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:30.620
The fact that this was a conversation that
took place at the highest levels is completely

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.870
outrageous.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.100
And out of this world, a scandal.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:37.960
If the world made sense, Donald Trump would
have already resigned.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.650
Based on everything that bill, actually, if
the world made sense, Donald Trump never would

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.720
have been elected, given that he was, if the
world made sense.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:50.430
The countless scandals that Donald Trump has
been involved in would have led to a resignation

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.430
long ago.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.780
The world does not make sense.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:57.270
And instead, we are faced with the very real
prospect not of Donald Trump's removal, but

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.269
of Donald Trump being awarded another four
years.

00:04:00.269 --> 00:04:06.769
And fascinating that there are Trump ists
who heard this news that Jim Mattis was thinking

00:04:06.769 --> 00:04:09.299
we may actually have to remove this guy.

00:04:09.299 --> 00:04:14.750
And some of those Trump has reacted by saying,
I told you the military was planning a coup

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:15.890
against Donald Trump.

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.390
Now, of course, Mattis is gone.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:22.760
Mattis was talking about this in his role
as a member of the cabinet.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.790
Happening to be secretary of defense.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:30.230
This was not a military action that was being
considered a cabinet action.

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:36.260
But the fact that they will excuse anything,
they will find a way to say Donald Trump is

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.610
the victim here, Donald.

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:45.010
Billionaire guy born with a spoon in his mouth
has become in the eyes of many of his followers

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:49.600
and in his own eyes, the biggest victim, the
most poorly treated man on earth.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:53.250
You would have he would have you believe it
is truly amazing.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:58.330
And again, I don't want to get ahead of myself,
but I'm putting together my thoughts.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:03.730
I don't think this is going to have any impact
on Donald Trump and we'll deal with that tomorrow.

